WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:01.670
Set,

00:01.670 --> 00:05.680
the truth is that you have 
royal blood in your veins.

00:06.420 --> 00:10.600
By all rights, you should 
be standing at the king's side.

00:11.160 --> 00:15.160
I'm sorry that I was only able to 
give birth to you in this form.

00:15.650 --> 00:17.350
But remember, Set...

00:27.000 --> 00:32.010
A Queen and the Future of the Kingdom

00:40.470 --> 00:41.590
Sire!

00:42.130 --> 00:45.140
Keep some distance from me, Sariphi.

00:51.580 --> 00:56.460
Returning to the form of a beast 
now will make no difference!

00:56.460 --> 00:59.480
You have already been unmasked!

00:59.480 --> 01:03.310
No throne will tolerate your 
weight upon it any longer!

01:11.190 --> 01:12.050
Curse you!

01:24.180 --> 01:30.220
Set, your warped obsession with species 
has led the people of this land astray

01:30.220 --> 01:34.490
and caused harm to those I hold dear.

01:34.920 --> 01:38.230
Even if I must relinquish my throne,

01:38.700 --> 01:41.180
I will see you pay for your crimes!

01:44.730 --> 01:45.790
Is that...

01:46.050 --> 01:47.040
The king!

01:47.040 --> 01:49.380
His Majesty is back to normal!

01:49.380 --> 01:50.530
Sariphi!

01:54.160 --> 01:56.380
Wh-What magical power!

01:56.380 --> 02:00.560
Half his blood is human, and yet 
he commands such arcane might.

02:00.910 --> 02:04.250
No ordinary beast could hope to equal him.

02:05.720 --> 02:09.330
S-So is His Majesty legitimate after all?

02:09.330 --> 02:10.140
But...

02:10.810 --> 02:12.930
That is beside the point.

02:13.710 --> 02:19.440
The strength that a king should wield 
is not the magic of the royal line.

02:19.980 --> 02:24.240
It is the strength to protect those 
who struggle to live in this realm.

02:24.590 --> 02:26.820
Because you failed to grasp that,

02:27.450 --> 02:29.660
you have no right to the throne!

02:31.670 --> 02:36.510
Protecting the people of this realm? 
You call <i>that</i> royal power?

02:36.510 --> 02:38.640
Don't make me laugh!

02:38.640 --> 02:42.710
If that's true, then why did 
no one protect my mother?!

02:44.190 --> 02:47.080
Merely because I was born looking like this,

02:47.080 --> 02:52.300
she was unable to become queen 
and died in obscurity.

02:52.300 --> 02:54.690
So I searched...

02:54.690 --> 02:56.520
And I found this!

02:56.520 --> 03:00.050
Sealed deep within the forbidden archive

03:00.050 --> 03:04.740
lay a codex of taboo spells that only 
those with royal blood can wield!

03:04.740 --> 03:09.600
With it, I shall prove that I 
possess the might of a king!

03:13.970 --> 03:15.200
What is that?

03:17.930 --> 03:21.290
This is a stone that the archpriest left me.

03:21.630 --> 03:23.310
The archpriest?!

03:23.310 --> 03:25.760
The one who's been missing since forever?!

03:26.050 --> 03:27.260
<i>I knew it!</i>

03:27.780 --> 03:31.370
<i>I am Archpriest Capel.</i>

03:31.370 --> 03:34.980
<i>I took on the form of a speechless devil</i>

03:34.980 --> 03:37.280
Wh-What's this voice?!

03:34.980 --> 03:39.240
<i>in order to safeguard 
the truth about our king.</i>

03:37.520 --> 03:40.990
It must belong to the one 
who gave her that stone.

03:41.470 --> 03:47.190
<i>There is one more truth 
that I must impart to you.</i>

03:47.530 --> 03:50.650
Mr. Archpriest's last words...

03:50.990 --> 03:56.350
<i>This is the secret that I was 
to guard above all others.</i>

03:56.830 --> 03:58.370
<i>His Majesty,</i>

03:58.370 --> 04:04.340
<i>our former king, was physically 
incapable of siring children.</i>

04:05.470 --> 04:12.050
<i>His Late Majesty shared a bed with many 
concubines in addition to his queen,</i>

04:12.050 --> 04:18.140
<i>yet neither Her Majesty nor any of his 
other partners ever conceived a child.</i>

04:18.520 --> 04:24.040
<i>At last, our late king realized 
that the cause lay with him,</i>

04:24.040 --> 04:28.910
<i>and he reluctantly claimed 
his brother's son as his own.</i>

04:29.250 --> 04:31.630
The last king had a brother?!

04:31.630 --> 04:34.840
That is His Majesty's true lineage.

04:35.310 --> 04:37.580
<i>To conceal that fact,</i>

04:37.720 --> 04:42.850
<i>when one of the late king's concubines 
conceived a child by another man,</i>

04:42.850 --> 04:49.110
<i>he falsely claimed the child as his own, 
and I signed my name as witness.</i>

04:49.430 --> 04:52.320
<i>This is another of my sins.</i>

04:53.000 --> 04:58.060
<i>Yet in time, that concubine 
became convinced of our falsehood.</i>

04:58.060 --> 04:59.400
Lies!

05:03.580 --> 05:07.240
"Convinced of a falsehood"?

05:07.240 --> 05:08.820
That can't be!

05:09.130 --> 05:13.080
As we speak, I now wield the power of a king!

05:13.080 --> 05:15.490
I will prove it!

05:15.490 --> 05:16.670
Otherwise...

05:16.670 --> 05:17.610
Enough, Set!

05:17.610 --> 05:18.460
Any more, and—

05:18.460 --> 05:23.100
Otherwise, my birth would be meaningless!

05:29.810 --> 05:33.190
What is... this?

05:34.170 --> 05:35.430
Your limits.

05:36.190 --> 05:40.320
Those forbidden spells consume 
immense magical power.

05:40.320 --> 05:42.900
You cast more than your blood could bear.

05:43.730 --> 05:44.660
Set,

05:45.070 --> 05:50.280
you became drunk on brute strength 
and never attempted to accept yourself.

05:50.510 --> 05:52.120
And so, you lost.

05:53.110 --> 05:56.370
<i>Is this... the truth?</i>

05:57.850 --> 05:59.960
<i>Everything I believed</i>

06:00.270 --> 06:02.410
<i>was a lie.</i>

06:02.960 --> 06:07.720
<i>What I sought was always beyond my reach.</i>

06:08.280 --> 06:13.230
<i>Then... why have I...</i>

06:19.370 --> 06:21.600
It doesn't matter what your reason was.

06:23.190 --> 06:27.220
If meaning only makes you suffer, 
you're better off without it.

06:27.610 --> 06:31.690
No matter how you were born, 
you can only ever be yourself.

06:32.110 --> 06:35.580
No one else can ever become you.

06:36.730 --> 06:39.620
What more meaning does your birth need?!

06:40.280 --> 06:43.340
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

06:43.340 --> 06:44.310
<i>Set.</i>

06:44.670 --> 06:49.260
<i>What I've always longed for was merely...</i>

06:49.660 --> 06:53.800
No matter what you look like, 
you're still you.

06:53.800 --> 06:56.260
Your mother loves you very much.

06:56.620 --> 07:03.690
<i>What I've always longed for 
was merely... merely...</i>

07:04.340 --> 07:07.700
<i>that one thing.</i>

07:08.180 --> 07:08.950
<i>I know.</i>

07:09.670 --> 07:12.050
I love you, too, Mother!

07:17.880 --> 07:21.320
You must be furious with me.

07:21.320 --> 07:23.780
Don't you mean the reverse?

07:24.050 --> 07:27.690
I've deceived you all this time.

07:27.690 --> 07:35.250
No, I have spoken out against humans 
many times in your presence.

07:35.530 --> 07:39.720
It is only natural that you could 
not unburden yourself to me.

07:40.030 --> 07:44.560
My weakness was to blame. 
That was no fault of yours.

07:44.990 --> 07:48.290
Even so, I cannot forgive myself.

07:49.220 --> 07:52.780
Once my wounds heal somewhat 
and I am able to walk,

07:52.780 --> 07:55.380
I intend to leave this realm.

07:56.670 --> 08:01.490
In all this time, I have done nothing 
but hound and harm you.

08:02.470 --> 08:06.950
Now that I realize that, I cannot 
bear to remain at your side.

08:07.200 --> 08:07.980
Anubis!

08:07.980 --> 08:09.970
You have the girl.

08:11.220 --> 08:12.560
I admit it.

08:13.320 --> 08:17.860
More than anyone else, she has 
guided you to become a mighty king.

08:17.860 --> 08:21.050
She became the thing that you needed most.

08:22.520 --> 08:27.090
You are right that Sariphi 
made me the strongest of all.

08:27.770 --> 08:32.820
But that was only possible 
because I had you, Anubis.

08:34.070 --> 08:40.440
To make a weakling like me a king, 
you've played the villain all this time.

08:40.440 --> 08:43.600
No one knows that as well as I do.

08:44.190 --> 08:45.620
Without you,

08:46.140 --> 08:49.430
I would still have been soft 
when I was crowned.

08:49.430 --> 08:54.120
And I may have been toppled from 
my throne before I ever met Sariphi.

08:54.700 --> 09:00.170
I could have crushed all opposition 
and made Sariphi my queen at once.

09:00.450 --> 09:05.170
I stayed my hand because I wanted you, 
of all people, to approve.

09:05.740 --> 09:10.980
I wanted the woman I truly 
love to be truly accepted

09:11.200 --> 09:14.840
by you, my first friend.

09:19.250 --> 09:20.820
<i>Hi, Sirius.</i>

09:21.460 --> 09:23.470
My name is Anubis.

09:23.470 --> 09:26.160
Your Highness must never 
treat a vassal as a friend.

09:27.070 --> 09:30.250
<i>I didn't care how shunned or detested I was.</i>

09:31.620 --> 09:34.220
<i>We could never go back to 
the way we used to be.</i>

09:35.200 --> 09:39.040
<i>I thought that I would never 
be able to touch him again.</i>

09:39.530 --> 09:41.280
<i>To feel this warmth.</i>

09:41.990 --> 09:43.390
Lacking though I am,

09:43.390 --> 09:47.360
lend me your aid a little longer... Sirius.

09:48.950 --> 09:49.680
What?!

09:50.080 --> 09:53.780
You knew that the chancellor 
hadn't turned traitor the whole time?!

09:53.780 --> 09:55.320
Of course.

09:55.320 --> 09:59.510
He's too much of a contrarian for 
such a straightforward betrayal.

09:59.510 --> 10:03.440
Then what'd you punch him so hard for?

10:03.950 --> 10:08.080
How could Set doubt Abi's loyalty after that?

10:08.680 --> 10:09.670
But anyway,

10:09.670 --> 10:11.630
the worst is yet to come.

10:12.300 --> 10:15.770
We need to deal with the sorting squads 
that followed Set's way of thinking.

10:15.770 --> 10:17.860
So I'd better stay on my toes?

10:17.860 --> 10:19.790
Tell me something I don't already know.

10:22.760 --> 10:27.130
Please continue to spar with me, 
Captain of the Royal Guard, sir!

10:32.470 --> 10:33.830
Thank goodness!

10:33.830 --> 10:35.260
It's still here.

10:35.960 --> 10:36.860
Look!

10:37.180 --> 10:40.570
So this is the diary you 
brought back from Yoana.

10:41.180 --> 10:44.520
You hid it in the passage I used 
to let the sacrifices escape.

10:45.250 --> 10:48.550
It might not bring any fresh discoveries.

10:48.840 --> 10:52.430
And you might end up wishing 
you'd never read it.

10:59.120 --> 11:05.250
<i>A life with a human mother and a beast 
father is now growing inside me.</i>

11:05.890 --> 11:09.110
<i>This child may resent its beast father.</i>

11:09.730 --> 11:12.880
<i>Or it may resent me for loving a beast.</i>

11:13.920 --> 11:18.720
<i>A beast I met one year ago, 
in the forest near the border.</i>

11:19.140 --> 11:22.280
<i>He'd been horribly wounded in battle.</i>

11:22.740 --> 11:25.830
<i>"I won't hurt you, so please, 
let me die in peace."</i>

11:26.260 --> 11:30.640
<i>He said that with such a sad look 
in his eyes that I heard him out.</i>

11:31.450 --> 11:34.080
<i>His family cast him out 
as soon as he was born,</i>

11:34.080 --> 11:36.620
<i>so he had no home or 
loved ones to return to.</i>

11:37.360 --> 11:43.120
<i>He could only win recognition by fighting, 
but he was sick of hurting people.</i>

11:43.710 --> 11:47.550
<i>He just wanted to live loving someone 
and being loved by them.</i>

11:48.000 --> 11:53.090
<i>He was so different from 
my image of a beast.</i>

11:54.040 --> 11:55.080
Don't cry.

11:56.250 --> 11:59.570
I'll love you.

12:00.640 --> 12:04.960
<i>My whole family shunned me 
because I have red eyes like a witch,</i>

12:04.960 --> 12:08.070
<i>and he was all alone, 
never even given a name.</i>

12:08.490 --> 12:13.040
<i>Looking back now, our meeting 
must have been fate.</i>

12:14.220 --> 12:19.790
<i>Though he was taken from us all too soon, 
I'll tell our child for him.</i>

12:20.880 --> 12:26.560
<i>"Your father couldn't wait 
for you to be born," I'll say.</i>

12:26.560 --> 12:29.040
<i>"You were born loved."</i>

12:29.950 --> 12:31.280
<i>"And someday,</i>

12:31.740 --> 12:38.420
<i>I want you to love someone—
and yourself—with all your heart, too."</i>

12:39.010 --> 12:40.220
Sire?

12:40.220 --> 12:42.650
No, I'm fine.

12:43.140 --> 12:44.020
Okay.

12:45.110 --> 12:46.070
<i>I understand.</i>

12:46.660 --> 12:49.280
<i>Those aren't sad tears.</i>

12:49.930 --> 12:55.550
<i>My baby kicked a lot today. 
I'm sure it will be born healthy.</i>

12:56.180 --> 13:02.050
<i>If my baby is a boy, my first gift 
to him will be the name "Richard."</i>

13:03.050 --> 13:08.070
<i>The same name as the legendary king 
whom people called "Lionheart."</i>

13:08.520 --> 13:12.180
<i>Please, let my baby have the 
indomitable heart of a lion.</i>

13:13.050 --> 13:15.950
<i>Let my child be strong and brave.</i>

13:17.010 --> 13:22.310
Now I feel as though I truly 
do understand who I am.

13:22.930 --> 13:24.930
Thank you, Sariphi.

13:25.360 --> 13:28.350
I just passed on a diary I was given.

13:28.350 --> 13:32.500
Anyway, I guess your real 
name is Richard, sire.

13:32.500 --> 13:35.190
Should I call you that from now on?

13:35.190 --> 13:38.670
No. My only name is the one you gave me.

13:39.260 --> 13:45.390
From now on, I'll face everyone 
as I am, keeping no secrets.

13:45.820 --> 13:46.640
And...

13:47.110 --> 13:48.730
that includes you.

13:48.730 --> 13:49.740
Me?

13:55.220 --> 14:00.320
Oh, is resuming the ceremony where 
they left off really a good idea?!

14:00.320 --> 14:02.660
Like I said, it'll be fine.

14:02.660 --> 14:04.490
More importantly, your scar.

14:04.490 --> 14:07.660
Why didn't you ask Sari's holy beast to heal it?

14:07.660 --> 14:10.470
What? W-Well...

14:11.160 --> 14:13.430
Lante told me what happened.

14:13.890 --> 14:15.350
Forgive me.

14:15.350 --> 14:19.610
I, a knight, am unscathed, 
while you suffered such a wound.

14:19.610 --> 14:23.860
N-No, I did this to myself!

14:23.860 --> 14:25.100
Besides,

14:25.100 --> 14:28.610
I'm glad that even I was 
able to make myself useful.

14:28.610 --> 14:32.050
It wasn't much compared 
to all of your contributions,

14:32.050 --> 14:36.200
but to me, this scar is a badge of honor.

14:38.380 --> 14:42.860
Then an apology from me 
would merely wound your pride.

14:42.860 --> 14:43.740
What?!

14:45.180 --> 14:49.640
You have my gratitude for 
the aid you rendered my king.

14:50.400 --> 14:53.900
I know of no hand more beautiful.

14:56.330 --> 14:57.040
<b>BLUSH</b>

14:57.100 --> 14:59.580
Princess Amit?!

14:58.260 --> 15:00.120
Seriously, is she all right?

15:00.400 --> 15:01.490
Silence!

15:02.240 --> 15:03.710
His Majesty approaches!

15:15.590 --> 15:22.100
Several days ago, on this spot, I appeared 
in a form that I have long concealed.

15:22.520 --> 15:25.600
It is true that half of my blood is human.

15:26.040 --> 15:30.610
Proving my royal lineage 
will not change that fact.

15:30.990 --> 15:35.520
But my efforts to mend relations with Yoana

15:35.520 --> 15:38.890
were not driven by a desire 
to conceal my lineage.

15:39.520 --> 15:40.570
I did that

15:40.870 --> 15:43.420
because I learned to love someone.

15:44.230 --> 15:47.250
She was merely an unfortunate girl,

15:47.250 --> 15:49.470
given to Ozmargo as a sacrifice.

15:49.950 --> 15:56.690
But no one is as strong of heart as her, 
and she has sustained my own, weak heart.

15:58.190 --> 16:02.010
She simply faced others as people, 
not as beasts or humans,

16:02.360 --> 16:06.520
and her spirit moved me... and many others.

16:07.730 --> 16:10.460
Loving her brought me to a realization.

16:11.250 --> 16:16.050
The kingdom I should truly strive for 
is one unbound by species or birth,

16:16.050 --> 16:21.080
where people are free to love 
and be loved as they are.

16:34.550 --> 16:36.770
Hey! It's the lady from that time!

16:38.610 --> 16:44.060
No doubt some of you cannot forgive me 
for having human blood and hiding it.

16:44.060 --> 16:46.140
But I want you to trust me one more time.

16:46.500 --> 16:53.590
With Sariphi at my side, I swear to 
defend Ozmargo until my dying breath.

16:54.030 --> 17:00.230
Once more, I want you to entrust all 
of your presents and your futures

17:00.230 --> 17:03.250
to me, as the new king of Ozmargo:

17:03.250 --> 17:05.060
Leonhart!

17:13.760 --> 17:16.130
Long live King Leonhart!

17:15.550 --> 17:17.720
Long live Queen Sariphi!

17:25.600 --> 17:28.800
<i>That's my Leonhart.</i>

17:46.860 --> 17:51.020
Tomorrow, our second meeting 
with Yoana will proceed as planned.

17:51.020 --> 17:53.290
Forgive me for rushing you, sire,

17:53.290 --> 17:55.780
but please prepare immediately 
after the ceremony.

17:55.780 --> 17:57.010
I understand.

17:57.370 --> 17:59.790
This is the most vital time.

17:59.790 --> 18:02.380
Even newlyweds must attend 
to serious matters.

18:02.380 --> 18:04.720
You need have no fear.

18:04.720 --> 18:10.360
We will devote our hearts and souls to 
Your Majesty more than ever before.

18:10.750 --> 18:12.350
I'm counting on you.

18:12.630 --> 18:15.530
Queen Sariphi is ready now.

18:30.680 --> 18:32.330
H-How do I look?

18:34.030 --> 18:35.250
You look lovely.

18:35.780 --> 18:39.650
My queen is more beautiful 
than anything in the world.

18:41.590 --> 18:43.370
Come. It's time.

18:43.370 --> 18:46.520
Oh, just one thing first.

18:47.150 --> 18:50.930
Before I become queen for real, 
I want you to hear

18:51.310 --> 18:54.390
how I feel now, just as me.

18:55.700 --> 18:59.850
I grew up in the small northern village of Noel.

19:00.390 --> 19:03.470
I had a mom, a dad, and a big sister.

19:03.470 --> 19:06.540
I never doubted that I was happy...

19:07.150 --> 19:09.300
until I learned about the sacrifices.

19:10.330 --> 19:12.500
I accepted my destiny.

19:12.970 --> 19:17.270
That was so much easier than 
brooding over or struggling against it.

19:17.720 --> 19:18.700
But...

19:19.310 --> 19:22.960
I was really just running 
from my own feelings.

19:23.440 --> 19:24.930
I was always weak.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.880
But, you know,

19:27.690 --> 19:30.280
everything changed when I met you.

19:30.890 --> 19:36.690
Because you chose me, I was 
able to face my own destiny.

19:37.780 --> 19:41.550
And now, from the bottom of my heart,

19:41.550 --> 19:45.900
I feel truly glad that I lived to see today!

19:46.780 --> 19:50.790
So I hope you'll stay with 
me forever, warts and all.

19:52.050 --> 19:54.160
Yes. I feel the same.

19:55.080 --> 19:58.770
<i>I'm so glad that I was born me.</i>

20:01.610 --> 20:02.420
<i>Say, Leo.</i>

20:03.260 --> 20:05.140
<i>Tomorrow, and the day after,</i>

20:05.140 --> 20:07.020
<i>even a decade or a century from now,</i>

20:07.020 --> 20:08.720
I'll always feel this way.

20:09.370 --> 20:16.020
<i>I was truly lucky to get to live 
with everyone and by your side.</i>

20:16.440 --> 20:17.550
<i>Truly.</i>

20:17.980 --> 20:19.750
Let's go, Sariphi.

20:19.750 --> 20:20.690
Right.

20:21.620 --> 20:23.400
<i>This is only the beginning.</i>

20:23.880 --> 20:28.350
<i>For this kingdom, 
for everyone... and for us.</i>

20:32.120 --> 20:33.710
Your Highness!

20:33.710 --> 20:35.960
Prince Richard!

20:35.960 --> 20:38.030
You slipped out of your lessons again!

20:38.030 --> 20:40.910
Lord Anubis will be furious with us!

20:40.330 --> 20:41.690
Us!

20:41.690 --> 20:43.650
That's the problem!

20:43.650 --> 20:46.590
I can't stand Anubis because he's always angry.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.100
That's why I run away!

20:51.000 --> 20:52.960
We've got you now.

20:56.300 --> 20:58.970
No fair, Your Highness!

20:56.760 --> 20:57.700
Goodness!

20:58.970 --> 21:03.160
Prince Richard's transformations 
barely faze me anymore.

21:03.160 --> 21:03.990
Same here.

21:03.990 --> 21:08.480
I never thought the day would come 
that I got used to seeing humans.

21:10.760 --> 21:14.320
Prince Richard is certainly 
a lively young man, isn't he?

21:14.320 --> 21:18.240
Yes, although I worry he may be 
too rambunctious for his own good.

21:18.930 --> 21:23.060
King Leonhart could never have 
spent his youth like that.

21:23.750 --> 21:28.340
When I think of that, 
his childishness seems charming.

21:28.650 --> 21:34.070
If I had a child of my own, I'd want them 
to be unfettered like the prince.

21:34.390 --> 21:36.510
I feel the same way.

21:38.460 --> 21:41.440
O-Only hypothetically, of course.

21:41.440 --> 21:43.720
Yes, hypothetically.

21:44.250 --> 21:45.530
Gotcha.

21:45.810 --> 21:47.620
Lante! What gives?!

21:47.620 --> 21:50.260
I thought you were on my side!

21:50.260 --> 21:54.850
Sorry, Your Highness. I side with Her Majesty.

21:54.850 --> 21:57.470
Come on. The chancellor is waiting for you.

21:58.000 --> 22:01.210
Now, let us resume your lesson.

22:01.550 --> 22:03.410
I've had enough!

22:03.690 --> 22:06.920
I'd rather train with Lante than study.

22:07.210 --> 22:10.410
A king of beasts just has to be strong, right?

22:10.410 --> 22:14.210
Those days are over.

22:14.210 --> 22:17.840
You'll need more than powerful 
magic to become a great king.

22:18.170 --> 22:21.420
You must learn history and culture, 
both domestic and foreign,

22:21.420 --> 22:25.800
broaden your horizons, and become 
a king who can guide others.

22:25.800 --> 22:27.160
Guide others?

22:27.160 --> 22:28.080
Indeed.

22:28.650 --> 22:32.280
Listen to the voices of many people 
and sympathize with their pain.

22:32.780 --> 22:38.730
That is how your father and mother 
have guided our land to this day.

22:41.030 --> 22:42.280
Hey, Anubis,

22:42.280 --> 22:45.250
in that case, tell me about 
my mom and dad today!

22:45.250 --> 22:47.780
I wanna hear about what they 
did before they had me!

22:47.780 --> 22:48.950
What?

22:48.950 --> 22:51.570
Oh, very well.

22:51.570 --> 22:54.040
That <i>is</i> part of what a monarch ought to know.

22:54.040 --> 22:55.450
Yes!

22:55.450 --> 22:59.980
But you mustn't tell your 
father that I told you.

22:59.980 --> 23:00.980
Right!

23:01.390 --> 23:07.450
In those days, our land was still entirely 
isolated from Yoana diplomatically.

23:07.450 --> 23:11.180
The one exception to this inviolable 
rule was the practice of sacrifice,

23:11.180 --> 23:14.000
by means of which a lone 
girl came to our land.

23:15.500 --> 23:20.800
At first, I saw her as a wretched creature...

23:21.680 --> 23:24.850
<i>At the ends of the earth, 
blanketed by miasma,</i>

23:24.850 --> 23:28.970
<i>lay a kingdom that was once 
called a forbidden realm.</i>

23:28.970 --> 23:32.960
<i>There lived many beasts, 
ruled over by a kindly king</i>

23:33.870 --> 23:39.090
<i>and a happy sacrificial princess.</i>
